"beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":7053601,"initDialog":705360101,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[10090,1007],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/WQ/Fishblaster_70536/Q7053601","priority":5,"questId":70536,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":705360101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10090,"speakerName":"Klee","textMapHash":3508467802,"text":"Hehe, Dodoco defeated lots of bad Spikey Fish Warriors! Even the Spikey Fish King was no match!","nextNodeIds":[705360102]},{"nodeId":705360102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10090,"speakerName":"Klee","textMapHash":48240074,"text":"Dodoco, Jumpy Dumpty, and Klee's Sparks 'n' Splash are the best!","nextNodeIds":[705360103,705360104]},{"nodeId":705360103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2399576314,"text":"Truly unstoppable!","nextNodeIds":[705360105]},{"nodeId":705360105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1984720826,"text":"This game reminds Paimon of the incident happening in Cider Lake... Did Lisa base its theme on that?","nextNodeIds":[705360106]},{"nodeId":705360106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2573716170,"text":"But come to think of it, why go to the trouble of finding the invading species when they could just ask Klee to blow up every suspicious fish?","nextNodeIds":[705360107]},{"nodeId":705360107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3040219866,"text":"They could even give us some bombs and let us handle this!","nextNodeIds":[705360108,705360109]},{"nodeId":705360108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2100156994,"text":"You and Klee are like two peas in a pod.","nextNodeIds":[705360110]},{"nodeId":705360110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":198402962,"text":"Well well, from the looks on your faces, it seems like you're having fun.","nextNodeIds":[705360111]},{"nodeId":705360111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10090,"speakerName":"Klee","textMapHash":658722914,"text":"It's Lisa!","nextNodeIds":[705360112]},{"nodeId":705360112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":4157111074,"text":"You're here!","nextNodeIds":[705360113]},{"nodeId":705360113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1594731178,"text":"We loved playing Dodoco's Bomb-Tastic Adventure! What a fun game you designed!","nextNodeIds":[705360114]},{"nodeId":705360114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":743035258,"text":"Thanks for playing, I'm glad you enjoyed it. Hmm, perhaps I should come up with some new updates?","nextNodeIds":[705360115]},{"nodeId":705360115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10090,"speakerName":"Klee","textMapHash":614821634,"text":"Oooh, yay! Klee wants to see Dodoco going on adventures in all kinds of places!","nextNodeIds":[705360116]},{"nodeId":705360116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10090,"speakerName":"Klee","textMapHash":3589935282,"text":"No, wait... You must've spent a looong time working on the game, it must be exhausting! We shouldn't make Lisa work too hard...","nextNodeIds":[705360117]},{"nodeId":705360117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":3209711546,"text":"Aw, thank you for being so considerate.","nextNodeIds":[705360118]},{"nodeId":705360118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":3093575970,"text":"But if it helps keep you happy while you stay inside the city, I'll be more than happy to spend as much time as needed.","nextNodeIds":[705360119]},{"nodeId":705360119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":1777743218,"text":"Of course, I understand that you prefer going on your own adventures whenever you like. The game is just meant to be a new way to pass the time.","nextNodeIds":[705360120]},{"nodeId":705360120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":3711284466,"text":"Anyway, I have some great news, and I've also brought a gift for you, cuties.","nextNodeIds":[705360121]},{"nodeId":705360121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10090,"speakerName":"Klee","textMapHash":2073513394,"text":"A gift!","nextNodeIds":[705360122]},{"nodeId":705360122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10090,"speakerName":"Klee","textMapHash":2248847042,"text":"#Actually, I have a gift for {M#Mr.}{F#Miss} Honorary Knight and Paimon, too!","nextNodeIds":[705360123]},{"nodeId":705360123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":2957734778,"text":"We'll get to the gifts in a moment, let me tell you the news first.","nextNodeIds":[705360124,705360125]},{"nodeId":705360124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2034002002,"text":"Is the incident in Cider Lake resolved?","nextNodeIds":[705360126]},{"nodeId":705360126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":3133924042,"text":"That's right. Two Knights from the Investigation Team found the invasive species' nest and swiftly disposed of it.","nextNodeIds":[705360127]},{"nodeId":705360127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":557828850,"text":"The Knights have also determined the cause of their invasion.","nextNodeIds":[705360128]},{"nodeId":705360128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":2877200066,"text":"The species were accidentally introduced to the lake by a merchant without any malicious intent, so the Knights let her go after some lecturing and issuing a fine.","nextNodeIds":[705360129]},{"nodeId":705360129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":4076437386,"text":"Phew... Luckily they didn't cause too much trouble. But even Paimon thinks that merchant was way too careless!","nextNodeIds":[705360130,705360131]},{"nodeId":705360130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2135042562,"text":"The water in Cider Lake is safe!","nextNodeIds":[705360132]},{"nodeId":705360132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10090,"speakerName":"Klee","textMapHash":2811345458,"text":"Is it time for gifts yet? Can Klee go first?","nextNodeIds":[705360133]},{"nodeId":705360133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":1317844170,"text":"Of course.","nextNodeIds":[705360134]},{"nodeId":705360134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":4076234442,"text":"Klee's been returning home on time every day without being reminded by anyone, so I've been wondering what you're up to lately...","nextNodeIds":[705360135]},{"nodeId":705360135,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10090,"speakerName":"Klee","textMapHash":3604107378,"text":"Hehe~","nextNodeIds":[705360136]},{"nodeId":705360136,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10090,"speakerName":"Klee","textMapHash":4055749074,"text":"When I was home at night, I looked through Albedo's crafting book and learned to make this!","nextNodeIds":[705360137]},{"nodeId":705360137,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10090,"speakerName":"Klee","textMapHash":1897696586,"text":"Tada!","nextNodeIds":[705360138]},{"nodeId":705360138,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":985997466,"text":"Whoa, it's Dodoco throwing a Jumpy Dumpty!","nextNodeIds":[705360139]},{"nodeId":705360139,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10090,"speakerName":"Klee","textMapHash":43747930,"text":"Yep! I made a figure that looks like the Dodoco from Dodoco's Bomb-Tastic Adventure!","nextNodeIds":[705360140]},{"nodeId":705360140,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10090,"speakerName":"Klee","textMapHash":443918282,"text":"Even though I can't make it throw real bombs...","nextNodeIds":[705360141]},{"nodeId":705360141,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10090,"speakerName":"Klee","textMapHash":3600031778,"text":"I hope it'll remind you of the fun we had together and blast away your troubles and boredom!","nextNodeIds":[705360142]},{"nodeId":705360142,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3681598402,"text":"A big Dodoco toy! Paimon loves surprises like this!","nextNodeIds":[705360143]},{"nodeId":705360143,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":408656418,"text":"With this, it'll feel like we're adventuring with Klee and Dodoco wherever we go!","nextNodeIds":[705360144,705360145]},{"nodeId":705360144,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1098531850,"text":"Thank you for the creative and thoughtful gift, Klee!","nextNodeIds":[705360146]},{"nodeId":705360146,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10090,"speakerName":"Klee","textMapHash":1554750570,"text":"Hehe, I'm so happy you like my gift! I worked super hard on it!","nextNodeIds":[705360147]},{"nodeId":705360147,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10090,"speakerName":"Klee","textMapHash":3484314674,"text":"What's your gift, Lisa? I wanna see!","nextNodeIds":[705360148]},{"nodeId":705360148,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":2535445898,"text":"Well, I'm afraid my gift is a lot less creative than yours.","nextNodeIds":[705360149]},{"nodeId":705360149,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":2363965130,"text":"It's a storybook about Dodoco's Bomb-Tastic Adventures—","nextNodeIds":[705360150]},{"nodeId":705360150,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10090,"speakerName":"Klee","textMapHash":4278812138,"text":"An adventure story! Yay!","nextNodeIds":[705360151]},{"nodeId":705360151,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2318611810,"text":"Wow, a whole storybook!","nextNodeIds":[705360152]},{"nodeId":705360152,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":2833682170,"text":"The little cuties returned to Mondstadt and joined Klee on an adventure with Dodoco!","nextNodeIds":[705360153]},{"nodeId":705360153,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":2428434850,"text":"Together they defeated the bad Spikey Fish Warriors and then enjoyed an afternoon tea...","nextNodeIds":[705360154]},{"nodeId":705360154,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":3167935706,"text":"A most fitting way to end Dodoco's Bomb-Tastic Adventure.","nextNodeIds":[705360155]},{"nodeId":705360155,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3491657890,"text":"Did you plan out the whole story while designing the game?","nextNodeIds":[705360156]},{"nodeId":705360156,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":3525645626,"text":"No. As the protagonists of the story, you, little cutie, and Klee all played an important part in bringing the story to life.","nextNodeIds":[705360157]},{"nodeId":705360157,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":1230789778,"text":"I've left a blank spot in the book specially for illustrations...","nextNodeIds":[705360158]},{"nodeId":705360158,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":626153498,"text":"But I just thought of an even better idea — since we're all here on this special occasion, why don't I take a photo of you together?","nextNodeIds":[705360159]},{"nodeId":705360159,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1078117410,"text":"Sure! We got to see our friends and play games together, that's definitely worth celebrating!","nextNodeIds":[705360160,705360161]},{"nodeId":705360160,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":959237018,"text":"Let's take a group photo!","nextNodeIds":[705360162]},{"nodeId":705360162,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10090,"speakerName":"Klee","textMapHash":1862100458,"text":"#C'mon then, {M#Mr.}{F#Miss} Honorary Knight and Paimon! Ready, Lisa?","nextNodeIds":[705360163]},{"nodeId":705360163,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10090,"speakerName":"Klee","textMapHash":2361385034,"text":"Klee had so much fun today! Three, two, one... Dodoco!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":705360161,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":729807954,"text":"You gotta treasure the small joys in life!","nextNodeIds":[705360162]},{"nodeId":705360145,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1945299946,"text":"Dodoco will come with us on all our adventures from now on!","nextNodeIds":[705360146]},{"nodeId":705360131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1660280522,"text":"Mondstadt's wine industry is safe!","nextNodeIds":[705360132]},{"nodeId":705360125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1837057250,"text":"Can Klee play outside again?","nextNodeIds":[705360126]},{"nodeId":705360109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2960314890,"text":"Nope, no bombs for Paimon.","nextNodeIds":[705360110]},{"nodeId":705360104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":330451458,"text":"Take that, bad fish!","nextNodeIds":[705360105]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7053601,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE